  "_comment": [
    "G2P calibration gold set — Badaplin War (2001), Ki Sawa Bad Ki Dur Kyntien",
    "Jong Ka Ktien Khasi, Lynnong VI 'Ki Dak Phonetic', pp. 55-56.",
    "These are the author's own phonetic transcriptions (|...|). Use them as the",
    "authoritative target for the DB's g2p_v1 output (phonology.ipa.surface).",
    "Run scripts/check_g2p_calibration.py to measure agreement.",
    "",
    "Notation normalised to IPA: aspirates as superscript ʰ (War writes kh/th),",
    "length as ː, vowels ɛ ɔ ɪ ə, palatal nasal ɲ, velar nasal ŋ, glottal ʔ,",
    "affricate dz. Each entry tags the phenomena it exercises so the checker can",
    "report accuracy per rule.",
    "",
    "Phenomena tags:",
    "  final_glottal      — orthographic final -h realised as /ʔ/",
    "  palatal_final      — orthographic final -it/-id realised as /ic/ (palatal stop)",
    "  vowel_length       — phonemic long vowel not marked in spelling",
    "  lax_i              — orthographic i in a closed syllable = /ɪ/ (not /i/)",
    "  y_nucleus          — interconsonantal y = vowel /ɪ~ə/",
    "  y_glottal          — prevocalic y = glottal stop /ʔ/",
    "  affricate_j        — orthographic j = /dz/",
    "  aspirate_onset     — onset aspirate /pʰ tʰ kʰ …/"
